00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.500
#SUICIDE

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:42.820
Mikoto!

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:45.660
Mana.

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:50.500
CHAPTER 43

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.520
ETERNAL LIFE
ODORO-ODORO

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:59.630
You seemed pretty serious. What's up?

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.490
It's nothing.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.510
I don't run into you after school often.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.960
Wanna go shopping?

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:10.670
Shopping on the way home is
against school regulations.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.540
Loosen up, Miss Class President!

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:18.180
We're not shopping.
We just noticed something.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:18.930
Right?

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:20.050
I guess so.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.800
If we're just looking...

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.820
This is so cute!

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:29.410
This would look good on Cat-san.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:42.550
Mana?

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.500
Kitaro, what are you doing here?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.710
I should ask you the same thing.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.200
We're on our way home.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.190
What about you, Kitaro?

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.500
I'm investigating the vampiric incidents

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.340
that have been happening
a lot around here.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.180
Vampiric incidents?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.220
You mean it's another <i>yokai</i>--

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.320
Bye, Mana! See you tomorrow!

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.700
Oh, Mikoto?

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.320
Daddy, dinner's ready.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:31.330
Daddy's busy with research now.
You know that, right?

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.200
It's fine.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.810
Maintain composure.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:50.350
Don't give in to your desires.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.480
Hey, Kitaro!

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.480
Oh, I'm sorry, Dad.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.110
What's wrong?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.010
I was thinking about the girl with Mana.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.080
You seem to have sensed something.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.250
Yes. A hint of <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:19.190
It was faint, so it's not like she's been
possessed by a <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.900
It's strange.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.380
What could it be?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.260
Kitaro!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:30.080
This was in the mailbox.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.750
Dad.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.000
This is...

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.750
Thank you for coming.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.000
I'm Onozaki. I sent you the letter.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:05.470
What did you mean?

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:08.160
GEGEGE NO KITARO-SAMA

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.260
You want me to kill you?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:13.040
And why am I
the only one who can kill you?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.270
I've heard about you.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.770
You can eliminate <i>yokai</i>, Kitaro-san.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.530
What's the meaning of this?
Could you explain?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:31.370
Until recent years, I was at a university
frontier medical sciences institute,

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:36.390
doing genetic manipulation research
under the subject of eternal life.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:40.380
And I finally succeeded in creating
an immortal cell.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.020
"Onozaki"?

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:47.210
Are you the Onozaki-san
who developed the Onozaki Cell?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.930
What's the Onozaki Cell?

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:54.770
There was news an immortal cell was
created through genetic manipulation.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.930
But, that was...

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.960
Yes.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:05.440
At first the media praised it as
the "god cell" or the "hope for humanity",

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:10.880
but the researchers who attempted to
replicate it all failed.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.550
MIRACLE CELL
THESIS PUBLICATION CANCELLED

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.220
VERIFICATION TEST FAILS
MR. ONOZAKI SPEAKS OUT

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:18.950
I wasn't wrong! The results of
my research were legitimate!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:24.000
The ones doing the replication
were just incompetent!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.070
Forgive my agitation.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:37.410
Overcome with rage, I decided to do
a forbidden experiment.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.930
Human experimentation.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.650
Are you saying...

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:46.940
Obviously, I couldn't
drag anyone else into this.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.920
So you used yourself as a test subject.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.450
Um, I'm not really seeing the point here.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:59.060
Oh, forgive me.
I went overboard with my preamble.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:05.960
See the results of my experiment
for yourself.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.930
<i>Is everyone watching?</i>

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.320
<i>The immortal cell is real.</i>

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:20.000
<i>In order to prove it, I've decided to
use myself as a test subject.</i>

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.710
What will you do?

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:53.200
Because of my human experimentation,
I became the <i>yokai</i>, Odoro-Odoro.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.100
That's not all.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.390
Now I attack people and drink their blood!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.410
You're the one behind
the vampiric incidents?!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:08.770
When I become the Odoro-Odoro,
I'm no longer myself.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.880
I become a monster that
only wants to feed on blood!

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:19.580
At first I only became the Odoro-Odoro
and drank blood maybe once a month.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:24.500
Eventually it became once every two weeks.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.790
Recently, I can't go two days

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:31.280
without becoming the Odoro-Odoro
and attacking people.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:41.740
He sought immortality
and ended up a <i>yokai</i>. Pitiful fool.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:45.710
There are lines humans
were not meant to cross.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:50.230
That's why I'm begging you, Kitaro-san.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:54.130
Please kill me when
I become the Odoro-Odoro.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:59.450
What do you mean by
"when I become the Odoro-Odoro"?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.260
You still don't understand.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:08.980
I already told you.
The Onozaki Cell is an immortal cell.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:23.560
I've tried to die countless times.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:29.480
I've taken poison and tried
jumping to my death. But I can't die.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:34.980
However, when I'm the Odoro-Odoro,
I don't even think of dying.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:39.740
All I think about is fresh blood!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.040
I know I'm not in a position to ask, but,

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.870
I'm begging you, Kitaro-san.
Please kill me!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.750
I understand, but...

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.000
let me think about it.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.860
Kitaro-san!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.910
So, what are you going to do, Kitaro?

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.040
I saw that!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.340
It's a birthday present for your dad?

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.400
Then I won't tell the teacher on you.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.980
Thank you.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.370
How is your dad, by the way?

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:27.470
Your dad's so nice it makes me jealous.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.370
I know what happened, but...

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.880
I believe in your dad Mikoto--

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.880
Mikoto?

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:44.660
It seems cruel, but he's insisting.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:49.190
You don't want more
vampiric incident victims, do you?

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:52.650
That may be so, but he's still a human.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.610
Daddy, do you know what day it is today?

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:05.580
Come on, it's your birthday.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.240
I bought you a present.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.810
Could I at least see your face?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.850
I haven't seen you in months, Daddy.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:31.020
He may have indeed become an Odoro-Odoro,
but we only have his word on the attacks.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:36.150
We can't be sure he's really the one
behind the increasing vampiric incidents.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.420
Is that so, Kitaro?

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.450
I'm sorry, Mikoto...

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.680
Daddy's...

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:54.230
no longer your Daddy!

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:10.640
ODORO-ODORO

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.640
OTOROSHI

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:19.150
ODORO-ODORO

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.040
-<i>"Ge."</i>
-<i>"Ge."</i>

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.040
<i>"Ge."</i>

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.770
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.320
Catchick, get her out of here!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.860
Got it!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:09.430
Onozaki-san, get ahold of yourself!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.050
Don't!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.690
A girl interrupted you?

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:43.900
Yeah. While I was distracted by her,
the Odoro-Odoro got away.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.910
Kitaro, wasn't that girl
Mana-chan's friend?

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:49.260
Mana's?

00:14:56.810 --> 00:15:00.850
The name of my friend
who Kitaro met this afternoon?

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:03.420
Does this have to be now?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:05.420
It's Onozaki.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.340
Mikoto Onozaki.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.930
She must be that man's daughter.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.980
You know why I'm here, right?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.080
Yes.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.900
Where's your father?

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.990
He's back in his room.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.150
I see.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.530
Kitaro-san, please don't kill my father.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.560
He told you, didn't he?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:38.750
Daddy! Daddy!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.750
Mikoto, you can't get in Kitaro-san's way.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.750
Kitaro? You mean that boy?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.150
That's right.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:51.700
Only he can save me from this pain.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.890
Please don't kill my father.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.180
Your father is in pain.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:01.860
Do you want that pain to last?

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.570
Even so, he's still my father!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:09.360
That may be the case while he's human,
but when he becomes the Odoro-Odoro...

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:13.030
Even when that happens,
he won't attack me.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:16.030
He can tell that I'm his daughter.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:20.520
It's faint, but his love as a father
still remains.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:24.920
But what will you do?
Things can't go on like this.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.000
I'll do something about it.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:30.210
#SUICIDE

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:34.970
I'll gather people like this
and have my father drink their blood.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.680
That'll work, right?

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:40.480
You idiot! It's okay to drink the blood
of people who want to die?

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:43.310
In what kind of world
does that make sense?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:46.230
Do you intend to corrupt yourself
like your father?

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.670
Then...

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.990
Then what should I...

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:56.990
I didn't realize you were that tormented.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:10.250
Mikoto... Daddy can't...

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.630
Oh no!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.320
Daddy...

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:35.700
Let's split up!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.820
Got it!

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:42.580
Despite what I said,
I understand how that girl feels.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.580
When you were taken over by the Gyuki,

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:51.130
both me and Catchick
didn't know what to do.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.220
If we destroyed the Gyuki, you would die.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:59.140
Such a thing would be more painful than
cutting my own body.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:06.810
But to let you live as the Gyuki
and continue to harm the humans

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.630
would have been even more painful.

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:19.820
Mana!

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.790
Cat-san!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.040
What are you doing?

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.500
You woke me up with your RAIN message!
Why are you so mad?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.630
This isn't the time for that.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:32.520
But, it has to do with Mikoto, right?

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:37.260
I went to her house but the door was open.
Where did Mikoto...

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.670
Get out of here!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.080
Okay.

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:00.700
Cat-san!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.330
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.530
-Take Mana and run!
-Got it!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.820
Stop this already!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:22.220
I know you're in pain.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.720
Hair Needles!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.480
Daddy!

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.010
Oh no!

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.990
Hold on, Kitaro!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:47.450
Daddy, stop it! Please, Daddy!

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.920
That's right, Daddy.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.900
If you're going to drink blood,
drink mine.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.970
Don't... do it.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.850
Run, Mikoto-chan!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:10.980
The Odoro-Odoro can't recognize
its own daughter anymore.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.360
Finger Guns!

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:50.810
Mikoto...

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:52.560
Daddy!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.400
It's all right.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.290
This is how it should be.

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:58.800
Thank you...

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:00.940
for this.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.340
Daddy!

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.080
Daddy?

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:16.440
Daddy!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:36.600
ONOZAKI FAMILY GRAVE

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:52.520
I will never forgive you.

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:54.120
Never.

